Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, sorted categories, summed quantities, and exact decimal stock values formatted as two-digit JSON strings.

Ungrouped output is preserved. Invalid CSV returns exit code 2 with a useful stderr message and no traceback. Processing remains separate from argument parsing, and README includes a grouped example and expected output.

All 10 supplied tests passed unchanged. Additional checks passed for large decimal totals and malformed CSV.
